 "tier1Summary": "Washington is in a hurry. It reportedly wants a Ukraine deal before January and has proposed a four-way round with Russia and Europe before Christmas, while [[p:Yuri Ushakov]] invites European security advisers to Moscow. [[p:Vladimir Putin]] rejects local truces, and the war is spreading at sea: Ukraine says it sank a Russian corvette in Libya, and a Russian cargo ship burned off Finland.\n\nRussia's missiles in Poland were Kh-101s, prosecutors say; Warsaw went to NATO without invoking Article 4. Ukraine's refinery strikes now reach Perm, and a strike on Dymer killed 11.\n\nElsewhere, COP31 collapsed over fossil fuels, a tanker incident hit Iran's blockade run, and the [[p:Houthis]] claim a strike on a Saudi refinery.",
